=3D"comment__body"><p>Hi, I found a little mistake in my&nbsp;spreadsheet&n=
bsp;in staff responsibility factor - so I fixed it if anyone uses it downlo=
ad it again.=20
</p><p>The&nbsp;responsibility factor is 1 for small games, and for bigger =
games 0.7 if staff is not responsible for mission or value calculated with =
formula if staff is responsible for mission.&nbsp;
</p></div></div>
