v class=3D"comment__body"><p>Yes I can. Latest research shows features incr=
ease ratio at which design/tech points are generated. Thus, depending on ho=
w many features you cram in and in what field, you will change your T:D bal=
ance even more. Sliders stay the same, balance changes -&gt; you can get ev=
en lower quality games. For example if you add features to your action game=
