span>
</p><p>The slider guideline is correct i that you need to twice allocate on=
 the important field and never over-allocate on the minor field or under-al=
locate on the important field.&nbsp;
</p><p><span style=3D"font-size:13px;">Once that's done, the most important=
 factor is the </span><i><b>tech and design points.&nbsp;</b></i>
</p><p>Get the correct ratio of tech and design points.
</p><p>The game also computes a score using &nbsp;tech + design points and =
keeps track of the highest such score achieved by you. To get 9+, you need =
